foreach(string key in ConfigManager.GetKeys())
{
   manager.AddKey(Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(key));  // Assumes keys are strings for simplicity
}
string decryptedMessage = manager.DecryptMessage("yourBase64EncodedMessage");
```
Note: This is a simplified example and in actual implementation, the logging framework and configuration manager integration would need to be done correctly and efficiently considering the performance constraints, error handling, and key management aspects.
