Please note that this is a basic implementation and may need to be adjusted based on your specific requirements and constraints. For example, handling memory allocation failure gracefully, efficiently managing system resources, ensuring thread safety, preventing memory leaks, and optimizing for time/space complexity are all areas that require further consideration and refinement in a production environment.
