Next, we can use a linked list to store all logs. This will allow us to easily add or remove elements from the collection without having to shift memory:
```c
typedef struct log_node {
    event_log* log;
    struct log_node* next;
} log_node;

static pthread_mutex_t lock = PTHREAD_MUTEX_INITIALIZER;
